  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Employers and clients pay for working skills and reliability. They judge you by finished samples, punctuality and honest dealing.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is keeping a weekly study slot and finishing small tasks.
  </p>

